        "ARPCONTACT" = "8:Mike Griffin (creator) & Paul Córdova (maintainer, 2024–present)"
        "Keywords" = "8:"
        "ARPCOMMENTS" = "8:EntitySpaces Studio – modern code generator for .NET Framework 4.8 and .NET 8–10. Connects to SQL Server, PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite, Oracle and Firebird, extracting full schema metadata (precision, scale, computed columns, concurrency tokens, defaults). Generates strongly-typed entity classes with a unified, provider-agnostic API. Includes a modernized dependency stack, automatic binding redirects, and x86-native platform consistency for reliable native interop."
